WEBVTT

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>So far there are three fatalities.</i>

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.820
<i>Fifty-eight have been wounded.</i>

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:25.580
<b>Notice
Due to the appearance of aradama, an emergency
 alert has been issued, both for railways and...</b>

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:25.240
<i>Taito-ku, Chiyoda-ku, and Minato-ku
are currently restricted areas.</i>

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.580
<i>Shinjuku-ku and Koto-ku 
have been ordered to evacuate.</i>

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.530
The aradama that has 
appeared in Adachi-ku

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:38.970
is heading south on Route
1 on the Tokyo Expressway.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:43.720
The squads on duty are currently heading north near Shibaura in Minato-ku.

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:47.150
We've estimated that they will
run into each other near Edobashi.

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:50.100
Evacuation and securing of 
the area have been complete.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.480
Have the appropriate troops 
use the special equipment.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:57.610
They will take care of 
everything within ten minutes.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.820
Keep it back!

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:27.720
The defensive squad and raid squad: 
spread out in groups of two.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.810
The attack squad is to wait for 
the special equipment.

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:31.190
Draw your swords!

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:33.000
Utsushi!

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.690
Five seconds until the 
special equipment arrives.

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:48.540
<i>Since ancient times, a savage force called
 the aradama has threatened our country.</i>

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:53.640
<i>They are exorcised by sacred shrine maidens 
chosen by the divine swords, the okatana.</i>

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:57.690
<i>These maidens are known as Toji.</i>

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:07.320
<b>Episode 1  The Point of a Sword</b>

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:12.830
<b>Minoseki Academy</b>

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:19.840
<b>Special Religious Military Unit
 Minoseki Branch</b>

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.840
<b>Minoseki Academy
High School and Middle School</b>

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:51.860
That's enough!

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:54.550
Etou is the winner!

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.250
<b>Winner's Certificate</b>

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:02.040
The winner is second-year
 middle school student Etou Kanami.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:02.900
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.650
Congratulations.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.850
Thank you.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:12.790
The runner-up is second year middle 
school student, Yanase Mai.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:14.040
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:16.490
Congratulations.

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:18.120
Thank you.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:22.570
You are both representatives 
of Minoseki Academy.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.480
Good luck at nationals.

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:25.390
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:26.190
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:39.830
Yeah, we're going to Kamakura 
tomorrow by shinkansen.

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:43.080
Yep... Mhmm...

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.990
I know, no matter how much I want to,

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:48.250
I'm not just going to challenge 
people right away—

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:49.530
Kanami-chan!

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:51.470
Sorry, a friend's here.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.350
Mai-chan!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:57.390
Are you finished getting ready 
for tomorrow, Kanami-chan?

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:58.650
I'm still working on it.

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:01.230
I've been on the phone with my dad...

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:10.060
I came to give you your shinkansen ticket,
 but I think I'll hold on to it.

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:11.910
Yeah, please do.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:17.910
U-Um...

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:24.380
It's nothing, I'm sorry. Good night.

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:26.310
Good night.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:02.390
I'm home.

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:15.550
It's been cleaned out?

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:16.390
The Origami family!

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:31.650
<b>Juujou Kagari-sama</b>

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.460
I'll be going now.

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:50.810
Don't mix up which stop you get off at.

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:52.210
You would totally do that, Kanami.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.560
I-I'll be fine! Mai-chan is with me!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.700
Always depending on Mai.

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:03.670
I cannot believe that my quiet young mistress
is a representing Minoseki Academy.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:07.350
P-Please stop, Shibata-san, 
you're embarrassing me.

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:09.860
<b>Special Religious Military Unit Identification</b>

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:09.860
And this is my identification.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.290
Thank you.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.930
We'll be going now!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.270
Thank you.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:15.050
We'll all come cheer you on tomorrow!

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:16.570
We'll be going now!

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:18.280
Good luck!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.540
<b>Eel Lunch Box</b>

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:27.040
Lunch boxes!

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:29.130
It's too soon to eat, though, isn't it?

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.500
Here, have these.

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:35.710
Mai-chan's cookies!

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:36.670
Thanks!

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:41.240
I was so nervous that I couldn't sleep, 
so I wound up baking them.

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:42.350
At night?

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.090
Yeah.

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:47.530
Handling the flour, rolling out the dough,

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:50.900
and watching them bake in the 
oven is soothing somehow.

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:54.360
I love your cookies, Mai-chan!

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:59.360
I love seeing your happy 
face when you enjoy them.

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:01.430
They're so good!

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:05.460
We should be there in two hours, right?

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:09.670
Yes, we change trains at Shin-Yokohama.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:13.310
The matches are held in before the 
Origami family. I'm so excited!

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:16.410
You're more excited than nervous, aren't you?

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:19.450
We're going to get to see so 
many swordfighting styles!

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:21.430
That's so you.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:27.670
The weather is so nice!

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:30.280
Let's see, the Origami family's mansion is...

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:35.690
Those are Ayanokouji uniforms, aren't they?

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.730
Ayanokouji, huh?

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:40.390
Those are Renpu uniforms.

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:45.200
And that's the Osafune Girls' School, I think.

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:48.920
That means one of them could 
be my opponent tomorrow.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.190
I guess so.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.220
Let's go!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:52.920
Kanami-chan!

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.720
It's huge!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.790
This is the Origami family mansion.

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:06.950
The household the country entrusted 
with overseeing the okatana.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:19.610
That uniform is from
 Heijou Institute, I think.

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:31.970
H-Hi there! Um, are you going 
to be competing tomorrow?

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:50.090
What's the matter?

00:10:00.710 --> 00:10:03.570
This bath is incredible!
That's the Origami family for you.

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:09.380
I wonder if that girl earlier is the 
representative from the Heijou Institute.

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:13.410
We might have to face her 
in the match tomorrow.

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:16.920
I'll wash your back for you, Mai-chan.

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:19.290
B-But—

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:20.510
It's totally fine!

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.050
Here I go!

00:10:26.260 --> 00:10:28.410
I-I'm fine now.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:29.480
You sure?

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:31.850
Now, it's my turn.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:37.060
I ate so much!

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:41.340
It's almost like we're having 
fun on a hot springs trip.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:45.410
What are you talking about? 
The real fun will be the matches tomorrow!

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:48.970
You really like swordfighting, 
don't you, Kanami-chan?

00:10:48.970 --> 00:10:50.670
Yeah, I love it.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:53.160
Oh, I also love your cookies.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.190
I guess I'm still pretty nervous.

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:03.170
Maybe it's because we're facing 
off with okatana tomorrow.

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:05.680
What will I do if I mess up using utsushi?

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:08.020
Let's practice in the garden, then.

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:14.360
Chidori.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.190
Magorokukanemoto.

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:25.260
Take your stance.

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:26.330
Utsushi.

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:40.550
You seem to be fine.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.210
Want to spar before we go to bed?

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:44.250
Th-That's enough for today.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.590
The actual matches are tomorrow.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.110
Tomorrow...

00:12:01.270 --> 00:12:02.920
Hey, Kanami-chan...

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:08.260
If we have to face each other tomorrow, 
will you fight me for real?

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:54.410
Welcome back from calming the souls.

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:57.250
Defense Secretary General Oda has arrived.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:02.670
You will only be observing the final 
match of today's tournament, Yukari-sama.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:05.500
Suzuka, Yume, and I will 
be securing the venue.

00:13:05.940 --> 00:13:07.860
And Yomi will serve as your bodyguard.

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:19.220
This is where the final 
match will take place.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:21.430
Let's go, Mai-chan!

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:22.520
O-Okay!

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.570
And that person is—

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:01.350
Kanami! Mai!

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:02.440
Everyone!

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.810
You made it!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:05.550
Hey!

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:06.570
Do your best!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:07.900
Are you nervous?

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:09.610
I'm totally nervous!

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:10.520
Huh?!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:14.410
That's Shidou-san! One of the elite guards.

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:18.790
She's last year's winner,
 and won the tournament twice in a row!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:21.560
Juujou-san, it's Shidou-senpai!

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:25.290
I got to meet her when she 
was still at our school.

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:27.420
<i>So only the elite guard is here?</i>

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:30.300
<i>I'll have to advance to the final match, then.</i>

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:35.000
We have quite a few young people from 
the middle schools this year, don't we?

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:39.920
The okatana are mostly 
compatible with young people.

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:41.710
This is the next generation.

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:43.900
Are you implying that you brought an end

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:46.030
to the previous generation
by winning twice in a row?

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:48.500
I'm not so conceited.

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:52.680
At least, that's how I 
feel when I look at Yume.

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:56.300
We will begin with the first round.

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:57.890
It's starting.

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:02.970
Bow.

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:10.200
Take your stance.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.170
<i>Kogarasumaru?</i>

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:21.600
It's a bout between your kouhai and mine.

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:22.950
Utsushi.

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:26.100
Begin!

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:30.860
A traditional style?

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.530
I wonder if it's Shinto style?

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:37.890
Jin'i! She's so fast!

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:45.170
That's enough!

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:49.640
Bow.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:52.630
Amazing!

00:15:53.190 --> 00:15:57.480
The second bout will be between 
Itomi Sayaka of Renpu Girls' Academy

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.340
and Etou Kanami of Minoseki Academy.

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:01.690
Come forward!

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:03.670
Good luck, Kanami-chan!

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:04.520
Right!

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:08.010
Bow.

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:13.190
Take your stance.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:15.650
Utsushi.

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:17.350
Begin!

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:19.750
<i>Onken?</i>

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:20.840
<i>Ittou style?</i>

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.020
<i>She's suddenly using jin'i?!</i>

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:24.040
Kanami-chan!

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.000
That was close!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.290
This makes me nervous.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:30.670
<i>I'm not hitting her.</i>

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:34.170
<i>Pay attention, listen well, 
and focus on your senses!</i>

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:37.010
That's enough!

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:39.320
That was so close again.

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:42.280
Why does she always win like that?

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:44.310
Mai-chan is up next.

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:52.520
Hyah!

00:16:58.190 --> 00:16:59.480
She did it!

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:00.240
That's enough!

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:01.900
I lost.

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:04.370
Did you even try?

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:11.370
Our job is to destroy aradama.

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.920
This is also important.

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:18.380
She used the hilt?!

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:19.800
Taisha style?

00:17:22.760 --> 00:17:23.680
What?!

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:29.060
I've been beaten!

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.560
<i>Juujou Hiyori...</i>

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:36.890
<i>I heard she had started attending 
the school right after</i>

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:38.580
<i>I'd been assigned to the elite guard.</i>

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:41.020
<i>She's amazing!</i>

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:43.950
<i>I wasn't just imagining 
what I felt yesterday!</i>

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:47.330
Etou

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:47.950
Ise

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:48.580
Etou

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:50.160
<b>Finals</b>

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:51.120
<b>Semi-Finals</b>

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:50.290
Maezaki

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:51.710
Yanase

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:51.710
Yanase

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:53.010
Bow.

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:58.070
Ugh, why is it Kanami and Mai?

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:00.090
This is nuts.

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:04.250
<i>Kanami-chan, we've faced each 
other hundreds of times.</i>

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:06.600
<i>We know each other's skills!</i>

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:10.270
<i>Mai-chan's seigan stance 
can't be easily broken.</i>

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.940
<i>I'll have to draw out her skills—</i>

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:18.690
She's using iai?!

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:20.190
Mai-chan...

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:28.200
<i>I'm going to catch up to 
Kanami-chan in my own way!</i>

00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:40.000
<i>Mai-chan, I want to win!</i>

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.510
<i>I want to win and fight that girl!</i>

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:45.380
That's enough!

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:58.400
Do your best in the finals.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:18:59.770
Yeah.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:12.350
You can do it, Kanami-chan. 
Just stay calm as always.

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:13.240
I will.

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:15.530
You might as well win
since you've come this far!

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:18.750
Juujou-san, are you tired?

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:21.300
Sorry, I just want to focus.

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:22.270
I see...

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:24.630
It's Yukari-sama, the head of the family.

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.680
She's so refined.

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:42.460
This is my first time seeing the
 head of the family, Origami Yukari-sama.

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:47.350
Same here. She's the great 
hero from 20 years ago, right?

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:52.280
Yes. They say that she's the strongest
Toji if you give her an okatana.

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:54.310
The strongest, huh?

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:56.330
We will begin the final round soon.

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:57.830
Competitors, come forward.

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:00.660
Bow.

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:05.170
Take your stance.

00:20:06.160 --> 00:20:07.170
Utsushi.

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:13.680
<i>What's going on? I'm so excited,
 I can't stop shaking.</i>

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:14.810
Begin!

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:17.860
<i>Sha no kamae stance?</i>

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:25.940
She disappeared?!

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:34.200
So that's your single sword?

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:46.670
Use jin'i!

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:51.820
Leave it to us.

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:53.760
It's fine. Don't go after them.

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:56.640
Yume!

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:04.770
I want to play, too!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.230
Hiyori-chan! Ready, go!

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:14.520
No fair!

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:17.790
Boo...

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:25.220
Chidori and Kogarasumaru. 
They're still hatchlings.

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:28.670
Kanami-chan...

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:37.670
Why did you get involved?

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:39.140
This has nothing to do with you.

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:43.020
Because we still haven't 
had our match, I guess?

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:48.030
Let's go.

00:22:13.090 --> 00:22:23.440
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:39.800
<b>Next Episode  The Distance Between Them</b>
